{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012Dd9vxwMsALGBZkBABrmh4","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# helping-hand\n2\t\n3\tAurora's recommender skill, packaged for Cowork/Claude Code install.\n4\t\n5\t## What it does\n6\t\n7\tOn every Cowork or Claude Code session start (and on each substantive user\n8\trequest), Helping Hand queries Aurora's curated knowledge base via the\n9\t`aurora-kb` MCP server and proposes the best matching skill, template, tool,\n10\tor agent for what the user is asking. Default mode is **approve-then-load** —\n11\tthe skill proposes; nothing loads until the user clicks.\n12\t\n13\t## Install\n14\t\n15\t1. Drop `helping-hand.plugin` into Cowork's plugin install UI.\n16\t2. Confirm `AURORA_KB_PATH` points at your Aurora installation's `kb/aurora.db`\n17\t   (default: `C:/dev/aurora/kb/aurora.db`). For collaborators who only have\n18\t   the GitHub-distributed snapshot, set this to the snapshot's location.\n19\t3. Restart the Cowork session so the MCP server picks up.\n20\t\n21\t## Layout\n22\t\n23\t```\n24\thelping-hand-plugin/\n25\t├── .claude-plugin/plugin.json\n26\t├── skills/\n27\t│   └── helping-hand/SKILL.md        # the recommender skill\n28\t├── mcp-servers/\n29\t│   └── aurora-kb/server.py          # local stdio MCP server (P7 scaffold)\n30\t├── .mcp.json                         # registers aurora-kb\n31\t└── README.md\n32\t```\n33\t\n34\t## Read-only mode (collaborators)\n35\t\n36\tSet `AURORA_KB_MODE=read_only` to open the DB read-only (URI mode). `kb.log_use`\n37\tbecomes a no-op so the shared snapshot stays untouched.\n38\t\n39\t## Status\n40\t\n41\t**P7 scaffold.** The skill + MCP server + plugin manifest are in place but\n42\tthe MCP server uses a minimal JSON-RPC loop rather than the full MCP protocol\n43\tnegotiation. P7.5 will swap in the official `mcp` Python SDK.\n44\t\n45\tThe keyword-overlap matcher in `kb.match_request` will be replaced by an\n46\tembedding-based similarity once the KB has ≥100 artifacts.\n47\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01D3vS1XSt6PQR86K5UNE1p5","session_id":"0e9f13f6-4032-41a4-8d9f-b9e18c221609","uuid":"da70a654-3b88-4301-990a-1ecb5abf5fdd","timestamp":"2026-06-23T18:39:54.771Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Explore discovery quality + value"}
