{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015SY2PgZr7Ac52fT3LcoafT","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# ask-user\n2\t\n3\t**Source:** https://github.com/garrytan/gbrain/blob/HEAD/skills/ask-user/SKILL.md    **Curator:** garrytan    **License:** (not yet inferred)\n4\t**Last verified:** 2026-06-23T07:15:15.427688+00:00\n5\t\n6\t## What it is\n7\t\n8\tReusable pattern for presenting the user with explicit choices and gating\n9\texecution until they respond. Used by other skills when a decision point\n10\trequires human input before proceeding. Platform-agnostic — works on\n11\tTelegram (inline buttons), Discord, CLI, or any agent with a message tool.\n12\t\n13\t\n14\t## What problem it solves\n15\t\n16\t- **Domain (axis 1):** `agent-internals > tool-use`\n17\t- **Complexity (axis 2):** rank 1 (recipe)\n18\t\n19\t_Embedder rationale: Reusable pattern for human-in-the-loop decision gating. Fixed sequence: present choices, await response, proceed. Recipe-level complexity with platform abstraction._\n20\t\n21\t## How to incorporate\n22\t\n23\t- Install / load this skill by referencing `ask-user` in the appropriate skills mount.\n24\t- For Cowork: drop into the plugin install UI as part of a `.plugin` bundle.\n25\t- For Claude Code: place under `~/.claude/skills/<slug>/SKILL.md` or a project `.claude/skills/` folder.\n26\t\n27\t_(Boilerplate fallback — no reconciler verdict yet. Static-only path; swarm validation will replace this on the next sweep.)_\n28\t\n29\t## Validation history\n30\t\n31\t| Date | Stage | Verdict | Score | Notes |\n32\t|---|---|---|---|---|\n33\t| 2026-06-23 | static | pass | 0.85 | Front-matter parsed via front_matter_strict: name='ask-user', desc_len=291 |\n34\t\n35\t_(Swarm validation not yet run — P3 will add runner + dual critics + reconciler.)_\n36\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01D3vS1XSt6PQR86K5UNE1p5","session_id":"0e9f13f6-4032-41a4-8d9f-b9e18c221609","uuid":"efd1288b-4718-47e7-b860-f89089834081","timestam