{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RkCSuw8MYXoySBzNL3fUqi","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# capture\n2\t\n3\t**Source:** https://github.com/garrytan/gbrain/blob/HEAD/skills/capture/SKILL.md    **Curator:** garrytan    **License:** (not yet inferred)\n4\t**Last verified:** 2026-06-23T07:16:47.767288+00:00\n5\t\n6\t## What it is\n7\t\n8\tSave any thought or content into the brain via one CLI command. The single human-facing entrypoint that replaces \"put_page vs commit-then-sync vs autopilot-wait\" with one command that just works.\n9\t\n10\t## What problem it solves\n11\t\n12\t- **Domain (axis 1):** `knowledge-work > inbox`\n13\t- **Complexity (axis 2):** rank 1 (recipe)\n14\t\n15\t_Embedder rationale: Single-command capture interface for quick thought/content ingestion. Fixed sequence: parse input → normalize → store. Low complexity despite backend abstraction—user interaction is one-shot._\n16\t\n17\t## How to incorporate\n18\t\n19\t- Install / load this skill by referencing `capture` in the appropriate skills mount.\n20\t- For Cowork: drop into the plugin install UI as part of a `.plugin` bundle.\n21\t- For Claude Code: place under `~/.claude/skills/<slug>/SKILL.md` or a project `.claude/skills/` folder.\n22\t\n23\t_(Boilerplate fallback — no reconciler verdict yet. Static-only path; swarm validation will replace this on the next sweep.)_\n24\t\n25\t## Validation history\n26\t\n27\t| Date | Stage | Verdict | Score | Notes |\n28\t|---|---|---|---|---|\n29\t| 2026-06-23 | static | pass | 0.85 | Front-matter parsed via front_matter_strict: name='capture', desc_len=195 |\n30\t\n31\t_(Swarm validation not yet run — P3 will add runner + dual critics + reconciler.)_\n32\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01D3vS1XSt6PQR86K5UNE1p5","session_id":"0e9f13f6-4032-41a4-8d9f-b9e18c221609","uuid":"245459f0-62d9-4581-bfc7-c942b6adad25","timestamp":"2026-06-23T18:39:58.053Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Explore discovery q