{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EtDByzkjpzVVV8MWUnjRZp","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# AI21: Jamba Large 1.7\n2\t\n3\t**Provider:** ai21    **Family:** jamba-large-1.7    **Version:** latest\n4\t**Vendor model id:** `(unknown)`\n5\t**Source:** https://openrouter.ai/ai21/jamba-large-1.7    **Curator:** openrouter\n6\t**Last verified:** 2026-06-23T11:12:33.002789+00:00\n7\t\n8\t## What it is\n9\t\n10\tJamba Large 1.7 is the latest model in the Jamba open family, offering improvements in grounding, instruction-following, and overall efficiency. Built on a hybrid SSM-Transformer architecture with a 256K context...\n11\t\n12\t## Capacity profile\n13\t\n14\t| Field | Value |\n15\t|---|---|\n16\t| Context (in) | 256K |\n17\t| Max output | 4K |\n18\t| Modalities | text |\n19\t| Tool use | unknown |\n20\t| Reasoning mode | _unknown_ |\n21\t| Knowledge cutoff | _unknown_ |\n22\t| Price $/1M in | $2 |\n23\t| Price $/1M out | $8 |\n24\t| License / availability | _unknown_ |\n25\t| Region | _unknown_ |\n26\t| Released | _unknown_ |\n27\t| Deprecation | — |\n28\t\n29\t## Benchmarks\n30\t\n31\t_No benchmark rows this cycle (Artificial Analysis key not set, or no AA match)._\n32\t\n33\t## How to select\n34\t\n35\t- Pin the dated id `ai21-jamba-large-1-7` in API calls (avoid floating aliases that silently re-version).\n36\t- See `library/_model_grid.html` for the cross-model comparison grid.\n37\t\n38\t## Validation history\n39\t\n40\t| Date | Stage | Verdict | Notes |\n41\t|---|---|---|---|\n42\t| 2026-06-23 | static | pass | model_json row (Bucket L) |\n43\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01D3vS1XSt6PQR86K5UNE1p5","session_id":"0e9f13f6-4032-41a4-8d9f-b9e18c221609","uuid":"81686e24-f638-4675-8982-b5686ff4f2bb","timestamp":"2026-06-23T18:39:58.432Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Explore discovery quality + value"}
