{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WEjJWz1U9bTVnbCpocKxgU","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tversion: 1\n2\tlast_updated: '2026-05-25'\n3\t# Wave L1 (2026-06-07): Message Batches API discount multiplier applied to\n4\t# usd_estimate when CostRecorder.record(... batch_mode=True). 0.5 ≈ Anthropic's\n5\t# ~50% batch discount. ESTIMATE — flagged verified:false in `verification:`.\n6\tbatch_discount: 0.5\n7\tvendors:\n8\t  anthropic:\n9\t    claude-sonnet-4-6:\n10\t      tokens_in_per_million_usd: 3.0\n11\t      tokens_out_per_million_usd: 15.0\n12\t      # Wave L1 (2026-06-07): prompt-caching sub-rates. cache_read ~0.1x input,\n13\t      # cache_write ~1.25x input (5-min ephemeral TTL). ESTIMATE — flagged\n14\t      # verified:false in the verification block below.\n15\t      cache_read_per_million_usd: 0.3\n16\t      cache_write_per_million_usd: 3.75\n17\t    claude-haiku-4-5-20251001:\n18\t      tokens_in_per_million_usd: 1.0\n19\t      tokens_out_per_million_usd: 5.0\n20\t      cache_read_per_million_usd: 0.1\n21\t      cache_write_per_million_usd: 1.25\n22\t    claude-opus-4-6:\n23\t      tokens_in_per_million_usd: 5.0\n24\t      tokens_out_per_million_usd: 25.0\n25\t    # Wave L5 (2026-06-07): CURRENT Opus tier. claude-opus-4-8 is the live Opus\n26\t    # ($5/$25 in/out), cross-checked against the bundled claude-api skill\n27\t    # (platform.claude.com pricing, cached 2026-05-26: Opus 4.8 $5/$25) — so the\n28\t    # verification entry below is verified:true. Cache sub-rates mirror the L1\n29\t    # structure (cache_read ~0.1x input = 0.5, cache_write ~1.25x input = 6.25;\n30\t    # 4096-token cache minimum per the skill). The 4.7+ tokenizer counts ~35%\n31\t    # more tokens than 4.6 (claude-api skill: \"Updated token counting\"); that\n32\t    # caveat is carried by `tokenizer_factor` (1.35), which is consumed ONLY by\n33\t    # the pre-call ESTIMATE helper in llm.py — NEVER by post-call metering, which\n34\t    # always u